WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:02.175
Read each vault.

3
00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:06.696
The hub's certificate vault has
role-based access, purge protection,

4
00:00:06.696 --> 00:00:11.863
a closed firewall and audit logs, but
public access on and no private endpoint.

5
00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:13.613
The payroll vault has everything.

6
00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:18.924
The portal's vault has nothing: no
role-based access, no purge protection,

7
00:00:18.924 --> 00:00:24.326
a firewall that allows all networks,
public access, no endpoints, no audit.

8
00:00:24.326 --> 00:00:26.933
Then its findings, one per missing part,

9
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:30.275
from access policies to
the missing audit events.

10
00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:32.740
One of three vaults has the full posture.
